{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39770","headline":"出关言怀 · 黄滔","name":"出关言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又乞书题出，关西谒列侯。\n寄家僧许岳，钓浦雨移洲。\n卖马登长陆，沾衣逐胜游。\n菜肠终日馁，霜鬓度年秋。\n诗苦无人爱，言公是世仇。\n却怜庭际草，中有号忘忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}